{
  "id": 191720871,
  "iid": 8961,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "bpv6: Prevent infinite loops",
  "description": "display_extension_block is supposed to return the current offset,\nnot the number of bytes remaining, which can be less than the current\noffset and cause an infinite loop. In the case of errors, set\nlastheader and return the current offset to break out of loops.",
